- I actually have one too.

00:10:37.386 --> 00:10:38.219
- [Ryan] Okay.

00:10:38.219 --> 00:10:39.317
- Guys, this is how it happens.

00:10:39.317 --> 00:10:40.150
- [Ryan] (laughs) Yeah.

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:41.730
- No, really, like, in
two and a half years,

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:42.580
you're gonna see, and by the way,

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.360
in 11 years, because it's just a thesis

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:47.520
that then will be
contextualized in 11 years

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:49.620
where we have the general knowledge,

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.410
what we put it into.

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:53.920
By the way, there's a huge play,

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.970
to go against that 80%
market share of Amazon.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:59.540
- Especially because Amazon,
as awesome as they are,

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:01.980
