care that much about books.

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:03.809
Like, I bet the books make--

00:11:03.809 --> 00:11:06.065
- When did they?
- 1% of AWS revenues.

00:11:06.065 --> 00:11:07.326
- [Gary] Oh, you mean, I see, I see.

00:11:07.326 --> 00:11:08.159
- Yeah.

00:11:08.159 --> 00:11:09.630
- You mean as a, 100%.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:13.090
They're in the place where
the financial aspect of it

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:16.570
