fast follow an innovation.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:19.270
- Yeah, yeah, and so, my point is,

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:21.460
I sell a book to a publisher,
they sell it to Amazon,

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:23.210
Amazon sells it to customers.

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:25.130
That works as far as books
go, but the problem is,

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:29.275
