00:14:12.453 --> 00:14:14.750
- So I think people think
stillness is meditating.

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:16.410
I don't meditate, it's not who I am,

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:18.120
I have too much energy,
it doesn't work for me.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:20.520
And so people go, 'cause I don't meditate.

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:22.630
There's so many other
ways to get to stillness.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.960
You can journal, I think everyone should

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.990
