00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:31.100
And I can't stop thinking about it.

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:32.610
It's been fuckin' a hundred days.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.443
- [Ryan] Yeah, that's the best.

00:17:33.443 --> 00:17:34.793
- That's what I like.

00:17:34.793 --> 00:17:35.626
- [Ryan] Okay.

00:17:35.626 --> 00:17:39.360
- I like watching people do
the right thing by people.

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:40.430
- [Ryan] Okay.

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:42.373
- I don't get enjoyment out of stuff.

00:17:43.603 --> 00:17:44.643
Like, I don't know why--

00:17:44.643 --> 00:17:45.550
- (laughs) Stuff.

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:46.480
- There's literally a website,

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:49.170
I don't know if the URL expired,

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:50.030
Dustin, take a look.

