I think it's GaryVeeHate--

00:17:51.286 --> 00:17:52.751
- [Dustin] GaryVeeHatesMountains.com.

00:17:52.751 --> 00:17:54.047
- GaryVeeHatesMountains.com.

00:17:54.047 --> 00:17:54.880
- [Dustin] It's still there.

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:55.941
- Yeah, yeah, I hate 'em. (clicks pen)

